<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>If with your sin and self you would be through,</l><l>Amen the Word of God!</l><l>If you would let the Lord your mind renew,</l><l>Amen the Word of God!</l><l>Amen the Word of God!</l><l>Amen the Word of God!</l><l>His Word is living, life-power giving—</l><l>Amen the Word of God!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Christ as the land of Canaan is our lot—</l><l>Amen the Word of God!</l><l>If you would enter, harden not your heart—</l><l>Amen the Word of God!</l><l>Amen the Word of God!</l><l>Amen the Word of God!</l><l>His Word discerns us, all that concerns us—</l><l>Amen the Word of God!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Jesus is coming, now He’s on His way—</l><l>Amen the Word of God!</l><l>Would you be ready if He comes today—</l><l>Amen the Word of God!</l><l>Amen the Word of God!</l><l>Amen the Word of God!</l><l>His Word prepares us, to Jesus bears us—</l><l>Amen the Word of God!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
